SUMMARY:Visit the Antique Car Museum
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nCome see a variety of antique vehicles a
 t the Estes-Winn Antique Car Museum! Located at the historic Grovewood Vil
 lage in North Asheville\, the museum features antique and vintage cars and
  even an Asheville City fire truck from 1922! Admission to the museum is f
 ree with a $5 suggested donation. There are two parking lots at Grovewood 
 Village\, one by the museum and one behind the restaurant. For more inform
 ation about the museum or about Grovewood Village\, please visit their web
 site: [https://www.grovewood.com/antique-car-museum/](https://www.grovewoo
 d.com/antique-car-museum/) We hope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/315752671
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260719T203552Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260719T203552Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
